# charly local state — never commit
#
# `.build/` is the build cache: generated candy checkouts (`_candy/`) of THIS
# repo's dependencies, recreated by every `charly box validate`/`generate`/`build`.
# `.containerignore` and `.dockerignore` are generated context-ignore files
# (gitignored org-wide by the shared ignore rules).
#
# Without this file a `git add -A` silently lands all of it in a PR — which is
# exactly what happened in opencharly/layer-cuda#10, where 18 of 19 changed files
# were this cache rather than the change.
.build/
.containerignore
.dockerignore
